entry.content:
dynamoi_get_billing: description  -funds +funds, -dynamoi_add_campaign_funds; +the Dynamoi dashboard at https://dynamoi.com/dashboard;
dynamoi_get_campaign_readiness: description  -dynamoi_launch_campaign. +launching the campaign.
dynamoi_manage_youtube_draft: description  -stays on dynamoi_launch_campaign. +is a separate step.

counterparty_check: description  -have +had -days; +days, measured on 29 September 2026;
vault_check: description, outputSchema  -read, +read on 6 October 2026, -controls +controlled -require one signature. +required one signature; `keys` gives today’s reading.  parameters: +`maxWithdrawUsd` is the vault’s own maxWithdraw(holder) as a LIMIT and is null where that answer is not one (a 0 beside a withdrawal that passed: Morpho V2 answers 0 by design); the raw answer is `contractReportedMaxWithdrawUsd` and `maxWithdrawMeans` says which.
vault_exits: description, outputSchema  -read: +read on 29 September 2026:  parameters: -where +where, on 26 October 2026, -sit: +sat:
